    <div class="w-[10rem] mt-5 mb-6">
        <Image
            class="fill-current rounded-ac-md"
            format="webp"
            width={300}
            height={300}
            src={url('favicon.svg')}
            alt="icon"
        />
    </div>
    <div class="mb-5">
        <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">About Me</div>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
        Hi all! My name is Nomi Wang and I am currently a junior at University of Iowa 
        studying Electrical and Computer Engineering, with a minor in Computer Science.
        <br />
        <br />
        I was born and raised in Shanghai, China and I spent the first 17 years of my life there.
        In Summer 2022, I moved to United States with my mom and I'm here ever since. 
        Finished my last year of highschool in 2023, and now, I am one year away from graduating college. 
        <br />
        <br />
        Say that Shanghai was the place that shaped who I was as a teenage girl. Iowa is the place that changed me to become a responsible and trustable adult.
        I started working a job the summer when I graduated from high school and started to pick on more jobs and works throughout years. These working experience 
        makes me cherish more of what I have currently and teaches me to stay hunger for oppotunities and keeps standing up for them.
        <br />
        <br />
        I'm trying my absolute best right now to find a full-time job after college so that I can free my mom from having to supply my through years of school, 
        that she can finally get her chance to pursue her dream in the States!
        <br />
        <br />
        Besides being a busy person chasing dreams, I'm by nature a tech enthusist(I mean look at this website lol). I love doing some weekend-long short projects to exercise my brain. 
        I'm also a book lover, reading a lot of sci-fi and detective stories. I'm also a sports girl. I played basketball for a lot of years and I do a ton of lifting and running recently. 
        My favorite sports teams are the Lakers and Iowa Hawkeyes Basketball (both men's and women's).
        <br />
        <br />
        This is a very long personal intro. Thanks for staying on this page for a while!  
    </div>

